      "Desktop companion for Company of Heroes 1": "Companion de escritorio para Company of Heroes 1",
      "Desktop companion for Company of Heroes 1. Replay analysis, live lobby scouting, match history, Relic leaderboards, Twitch overlays, and fair play checks that help keep the community clean of cheaters.": "Companion de escritorio para Company of Heroes 1. An\xE1lisis de replays, scouting de lobby en vivo, historial, clasificaciones de Relic, overlays de Twitch y controles de juego limpio para mantener la comunidad libre de tramposos.",
      Details: "Detalles",
      Detected: "Detectado",
      "Determines how closely the AI should adhere to the original voice when attempting to replicate it.": "Determina qu\xE9 tan fielmente la IA debe seguir la voz original al intentar replicarla.",
      "Determines how stable the voice is and the randomness between each generation. Lower values introduce broader emotional range for the voice. Higher values can result in a monotonous voice with limited emotion.": "Determina qu\xE9 tan estable es la voz y la aleatoriedad entre cada generaci\xF3n. Valores m\xE1s bajos dan un rango emocional m\xE1s amplio. Valores m\xE1s altos pueden producir una voz mon\xF3tona, con poca emoci\xF3n.",
      "Determines the style exaggeration of the voice. This setting attempts to amplify the style of the original speaker. It does consume additional computational resources and might increase latency if set to anything other than 0.": "Determina la exageraci\xF3n de estilo de la voz. Este ajuste intenta amplificar el estilo del hablante original. Consume recursos adicionales y puede aumentar la latencia si no est\xE1 en 0.",
